# Secret Invasion: "When this Aura enters, exile up to one target creature other than enchanted creature until this Aura leaves the
# battlefield. Enchanted creature becomes a copy of that creature until this Aura leaves the battlefield." {1}{U}{U} is paid
# exactly by Black Lotus. Bot1's Ornithopter becomes a copy of Bot2's Grizzly Bears (a 2/2 Bear named Grizzly Bears), which is
# exiled; the Ornithopter itself is refused as the target (the enchanted creature). Bot1 then returns the copy to its hand with
# an Aether Spellbomb: the Aura goes to the graveyard, and the Bears come back to the battlefield under Bot2's control.

